\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Church of God, arise,
\par And take thy lamp of love,
\par The light that never dies
\par On earth, in heaven above!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. With wisdom and with truth
\par Keep quick and straight the flame,
\par The light of love and youth,
\par To save a world of shame.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Rebuke the devil's mart,
\par The souls in prison release,
\par Bind up the broken heart,
\par Give joy and mirth and peace!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Whatever things are fair,
\par Whatever things are just,
\par Go, make them free as air
\par And pointeous as the dust!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. In every darkest place
\par Let radiant warmth be shed,
\par Till in each dreary face
\par The joy of God is read.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Tell every man on earth,
\par The greatest and the least,
\par Love called him from his birth
\par To be a king and priest.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

